Ceramic Bathroom Accessory Set delivers the perfect combination of style, organization, and everyday practicality, making it a beautiful addition to any home.</p>","features":["Includes a lotion dispenser, toothbrush holder, tumbler, and matching tray for a coordinated and organized bathroom countertop.","Made from durable, high-quality ceramic with a smooth finish that offers long-lasting beauty and everyday functionality.","Keeps bathroom essentials neatly arranged while adding an elegant decorative touch to vanities, sinks, and countertops.","Perfect for storing hand soap, lotion, toothbrushes, toothpaste, makeup brushes, rinsing cups, and other daily necessities.","Designed to blend seamlessly with modern, contemporary, farmhouse, and classic bathroom styles, making it ideal for homes and guest bathrooms alike."],"material":"Ceramic","origin":"China","care":"Wipe Clean","pileHeight":"","backing":"","shape":"","badge":"","featured":false,"hidden":false,"inStock":true,"swatch":"#C9BBA6","weight":null,"seoTitle":"","seoDescription":"","imageAlt":"","basePrice":0,"baseSalePrice":null,"skuPrefix":"","options":[{"id":"o_color","name":"Color","type":"color","values":[{"id":"cl_blue","label":"Blue","hex":"#8DB0CF","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/qwaybwda95oo30dok4mqp/BLUE.JPG?rlkey=dls45p3zkq1kakvikm1cplnfd&st=5e5ux5bg&dl=0"},{"id":"cl_black","label":"Black","hex":"#1F1F1F","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/4az2xgggn5cu45ap3ds0m/BLACK.JPG?rlkey=jugbqs9eijp5gswiw46afr3a4&st=famdfl7t&dl=0"},{"id":"cl_chocolate","label":"Chocolate","hex":"#5A3A29","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/6vekoxkp7h3uaoxebop99/CHOCOLATE.JPG?rlkey=0lia7egtoxilegpnm2dgcu7nq&st=fv49752a&dl=0"},{"id":"cl_coral","label":"Coral","hex":"#F08A6E","images":["","","",""