 machine washable, making maintenance simple and convenient. Perfect for master bathrooms, guest bathrooms, apartments, dorm rooms, and vacation homes, the Elmstone Decorative Printed Shower Curtain combines style, durability, and functionality to elevate your bathroom space.</p>","features":["Stylish Printed Design – Available in multiple colors and decorative print to complement a variety of bathroom decor styles, from modern and contemporary to classic and traditional.","Premium 100% Polyester Fabric – Made from durable, lightweight polyester that provides long-lasting performance, a soft feel, and excellent everyday usability.","Water-Resistant & Privacy Coverage – Helps keep water inside the shower area while providing privacy and a clean, polished look for your bathroom.","Includes 12 Metal Hooks – Comes complete with 12 durable metal hooks for quick, secure, and hassle-free installation on most standard shower rods."],"material":"100% Polyester","origin":"China","care":"Machine washable","pileHeight":"","backing":"","shape":"","badge":"","featured":false,"hidden":false,"inStock":true,"swatch":"#C9BBA6","weight":null,"seoTitle":"","seoDescription":"","imageAlt":"","basePrice":0,"baseSalePrice":null,"skuPrefix":"","options":[{"id":"o_color","name":"Color","type":"color","values":[{"id":"cl_blue","label":"Blue","hex":"#8DB0CF","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/j7e8i6bnpww14360xl0gb/BLUE.jpg?rlkey=mrpxbohjowps8xbi6wh2bssxz&st=2k2bxse0&dl=0"},{"id":"cl_black","label":"Black","hex":"#1F1F1F","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/dl6bdqweo5hyyyfwgbuwo/BLACK.jpg?rlkey=snkvqe4lq6y5z8pl8idtdd1l0&st=hfr2hvgt&dl=0"},{"id":"cl_chocolate","label":"Chocolate","hex":"#5A3A29","images":["","","","","","","",""],"primary":0,"video":"","swatchImage":"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/hgog1g9akxs7ft5049kz4/CHOCOLATE.jp